1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,730
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:03,410
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,050
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:06,610
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,570
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:10,330
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:13,690
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,410
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,130
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,770
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,490
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:22,130
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:23,450
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:27,290
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,740
=The One=

16
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:31,260
=Episode 14=

17
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,159
Kill all the posts.

18
00:00:33,159 --> 00:00:34,439
Bury it under a celebrity romance.

19
00:00:34,439 --> 00:00:35,439
If one million won't do, make it two.

20
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,119
Do it now.

21
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,320
Buy up every original photo!

22
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:37,960
I...

23
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,240
Su Yan.

24
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,679
Su Yan.

25
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:44,880
Tomorrow,

26
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:47,079
Cizhou will announce your wedding date.

27
00:00:47,759 --> 00:00:49,679
Once people see you're engaged

28
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,000
and your fiancé stands by you,

29
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,479
the smears

30
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:54,399
and hate

31
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:55,799
will start to die down.

32
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,280
Right now,

33
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:00,520
it's the only effective

34
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,159
and dignified way to handle this.

35
00:01:02,479 --> 00:01:04,640
So your solution

36
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:07,000
is to make me swallow these filthy lies

37
00:01:07,359 --> 00:01:08,239
and that's what you call dignified?

38
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:10,560
This is all over social media.

39
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:12,680
You can't just deny it and walk away.

40
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,480
Public opinion is against you.

41
00:01:18,799 --> 00:01:19,359
Thank you.

42
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:21,280
But I can't accept that.

43
00:01:23,159 --> 00:01:24,159
Don't be so ungrateful.

44
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:27,040
I came here

45
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:30,760
not to hear your "dignified" plan.

46
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:33,480
I came to find out one thing:

47
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:37,000
who stabbed me in the back.

48
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,879
That crazy woman from the Ge family.

49
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:41,840
This is all your fault.

50
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:43,000
What kind of lousy friends do you keep?

51
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,239
Professor Ge is divorcing her.

52
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,760
She's trying to ruin her own husband,

53
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,319
and she's dragging our family
into it too.

54
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:53,480
But I traced the photos

55
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:56,079
back to this house.

56
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:58,040
Was it you,

57
00:01:59,719 --> 00:02:00,519
Su Ya?

58
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,120
It wasn't me.

59
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,120
Ge Yao showed me those photos.

60
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,519
I deleted them right after.

61
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:08,719
I didn't know I'd lose my phone.

62
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,599
Ya.

63
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,120
How could you betray your own sister?

64
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,080
I didn't mean to.

65
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,319
Su Yan.

66
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:20,960
Su Ya was probably used

67
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,080
by Ge Yao and her mother.

68
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,280
She's not that bad.

69
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,360
She's not bad.

70
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,479
Just stupid.

71
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,400
Su Yan.

72
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:31,199
We have to go with our plan.

73
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:32,840
We're trying to save you.

74
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,840
Are you saving me or yourself?

75
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:51,580
Dad.

76
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:55,020
I want him behind bars.

77
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,060
Su Yan.

78
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:02,420
Settle this privately.

79
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:09,100
He has something on me.

80
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:11,580
This could save our family.

81
00:03:12,780 --> 00:03:14,100
Besides, if this gets out,

82
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:16,060
it'll hurt your reputation too.

83
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,460
He promised to compensate you.

84
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:32,759
I really am

85
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,639
trying to save you.

86
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:41,439
When I needed you most,

87
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:43,960
you chose yourself.

88
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,719
I don't need you anymore.

89
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,840
You taught me one thing.

90
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,000
In this world,

91
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:54,280
no one can save me.

92
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:56,280
Not even family.

93
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,759
In the end,

94
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,960
I can only save myself.

95
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:07,639
Move.

96
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,680
(Come to Meise, VIP Room 4.)

97
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,839
(I have what you want.)

98
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,660
(Su Yan.)

99
00:04:45,660 --> 00:04:47,220
(Tell me.)

100
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,100
(What would make you feel better?)

101
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:52,500
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

102
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:56,020
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

103
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:59,540
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

104
00:04:59,540 --> 00:05:03,300
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

105
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:21,780
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

106
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:25,420
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

107
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:28,620
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

108
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:32,300
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

109
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:35,700
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

110
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:39,380
♪I hum this song alone♪

111
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:43,220
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

112
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:47,300
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

113
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:50,580
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

114
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:54,180
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

115
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:57,660
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

116
00:05:57,660 --> 00:06:02,540
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
